  "id": "bruschetta-with-cheese",
  "name": "Bruschetta with Cheese",
  "subtitle": "Toasted baguette topped with tomatoes, herbs, and melted cheese",
  "description": "Crisp baguette slices are layered with seasoned tomatoes, fresh herbs, and two cheeses, then baked until hot and melted.",
